.DS_Store

# ⚠️ This repo IS the website, so an ignored image is a 404 in production.
# A blanket *.png here silently blocked favicon-32.png and icon-180.png from ever
# deploying: index.html referenced them, the commit looked clean, and the live site
# served 404 for both. Keep the blanket rule so stray screenshots stay out, but
# every image the site actually serves must be listed below.
*.png
!favicon-32.png
!icon-180.png
!hahn-tech-icon-512.png
!hahn-tech-logo-square-1024.png
!hahn-tech-logo-circle.png
!hahn-tech-mark-clean.png
!marketing/*.png

# Local-only backups of replaced assets — kept on disk, never published.
_old-icons-*/
